### ▶️ SERVER A — Random Selection & Stock Management (172.20.10.7:8080)

### [A-TC01] Fulfill 1 Matcha Lover Box (random item)
POST http://172.20.10.7:8080/api/boxes/purchase/Matcha Lover Box

### [A-TC02] Fulfill 3 Matcha Lover Boxes
POST http://172.20.10.7:8080/api/boxes/purchase/Matcha Lover Box?quantity=3

### [A-TC03] Fulfill multiple box types
POST http://172.20.10.7:8080/api/boxes/purchase
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "boxName": "Matcha Lover Box", "quantity": 2 },
  { "boxName": "Chocolate Lover Box", "quantity": 1 }
]

### [A-TC04] Update or delete item quantities
PUT http://172.20.10.7:8080/api/items/quantity
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "itemId": 3, "action": "delete" },
  { "itemId": 4, "action": "update", "deltaAmount": -2 },
  { "itemId": 5, "action": "update", "deltaAmount": 1000 }
]

### [A-TC05] Ping test
GET http://172.20.10.7:8080/api/ping
